T*
(7.3 Event rules) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Immutability: deny update/delete to application roles; corrections are new events.) Tj
T*
(- Idempotency: unique idempotency_key per producer/source fact.) Tj
T*
(- Replay: replay jobs read ordered events and write checkpoints.) Tj
T*
(- Ordering: use partition_key; no global ordering guarantee.) Tj
T*
(- Partitioning: start with indexes; later partition by month/tenant/event_type.) Tj
T*
(- RLS: users do not read raw events directly; service roles and audit/admin only; safe ) Tj
T*
(projections expose data.) Tj
T*
(- Audit: every replay/admin access is logged in audit.audit_logs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
