(26. Security & Privacy) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Area | Design |) Tj
T*
(|---|---|) Tj
T*
(| PII minimization | Store only required PII; encrypt sensitive fields where possible; use hashes for external IDs. |) Tj
T*
(| Encryption assumptions | Supabase encryption at rest/in transit; application-level encryption for high sensitivity ) Tj
T*
(fields if needed. |) Tj
T*
(| Audit logs | Sensitive reads/writes, admin actions, passport shares, AI evidence access. |) Tj
T*
(| Access logs | Employer/government/passport views logged. |) Tj
T*
(| Consent sharing | Consent gates integrations, public profiles, employer passport views. |) Tj
T*
(| Data retention | Retention policy by table/evidence type/jurisdiction. |) Tj
T*
(| Deletion/anonymization | Soft delete operational rows; anonymize where law requires; immutable events may be ) Tj
T*
(tombstoned/anonymized by policy. |) Tj
T*
(| GDPR-style controls | export, rectify, erase/anonymize, restrict processing, consent revocation. |) Tj
T*
(| FERPA-style controls | educational records restricted to legitimate educational interest or consent. |) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
